(A-D) SNP analysis and global distribution analysis of major variant loci of TaMRS2-13, TaMRS2-14, TaMRS2-19, and TaMRS2-20.
(A) SNP analysis and the variation of chr3A:657616238 in TaMRS2-13;
(B) SNP analysis and the variation of chr3B:689425056 in TaMRS2-14; (C) SNP analysis and the variation of chr5A:580280143 in TaMRS2-19;
(D) SNP analysis and the variation of chr5B:565772013 in TaMRS2-20.
